# Class-A ULTRA engine (scripts/lib/{explode,detonate}.mjs + tests) is deliberately NOT listed here.
# It was parked under this block as an ungraduated prototype; since the graduation landing (A1-A5) it
# is TRACKED SOURCE, gated by the suite like any other lib. It is kept out of the shipped plugin/ dist
# by the named UNWIRED_ENGINE exclusion in scripts/build-plugin.mjs (enforced in both directions by
# verify.mjs), NOT by this file — and it ships once the class-A SKILL surface wires it. Re-adding it
# here would change nothing in git (the files are tracked) while hiding them from ripgrep and
# re-implying "never ship".

